<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1824012440"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1560465051"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="decaying"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="xxsagexx"/><amll:meta key="album" value="decaying"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:35.779"><div begin="00:28.328" end="02:35.779"><p begin="00:28.328" end="00:30.389" itunes:key="L1">It's another boring day<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又是无趣的一天</span></p><p begin="00:30.609" end="00:32.699" itunes:key="L2">I'm stuck here on replay<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每日都在重复 (或许被困在这里了)</span></p><p begin="00:32.879" end="00:35.337" itunes:key="L3">I feel so alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我觉得自己是如此寂寞</span></p><p begin="00:37.418" end="00:39.639" itunes:key="L4">And no matter what you say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论你怎么说</span></p><p begin="00:39.828" end="00:41.848" itunes:key="L5">Life just suffocates<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活的压力令人窒息</span></p><p begin="00:42.028" end="00:45.397" itunes:key="L6">I feel so alone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因此我感到空虚</span></p><p begin="00:45.609" end="00:46.788" itunes:key="L7">Decaying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕落 我无法阻止它</span></p><p begin="00:46.939" end="00:49.049" itunes:key="L8">I can't stop decaying</p><p begin="00:49.159" end="00:53.687" itunes:key="L9">Life's a simple game but I don't wanna waste it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活也许只是一场简简单单的游戏 我不想让它流逝掉</span></p><p begin="00:53.809" end="00:55.838" itunes:key="L10">I can't stop decaying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕落 我无法阻止它, 堕落 我无法阻止它</span></p><p begin="00:56.009" end="00:58.148" itunes:key="L11">I can't stop decaying</p><p begin="00:58.328" end="01:00.467" itunes:key="L12">Feels like I'm dying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉好像快到达命运尽头</span></p><p begin="01:00.589" end="01:03.759" itunes:key="L13">Cannot change my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能操纵一切</span></p><p begin="01:04.000" end="01:06.229" itunes:key="L14">(Ooh) And it hurts so bad</p><p begin="01:06.368" end="01:08.577" itunes:key="L15">I don't wanna be stuck in the past<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再回忆过去</span></p><p begin="01:08.719" end="01:10.768" itunes:key="L16">(Ooh) And I know it's hard<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管很难做到</span></p><p begin="01:10.858" end="01:13.128" itunes:key="L17">Accepting everything beside the scars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我逐渐接受身上的伤痕</span></p><p begin="01:13.229" end="01:15.377" itunes:key="L18">(Ooh) And I will not stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我不会停止的</span></p><p begin="01:15.479" end="01:17.708" itunes:key="L19">Not 'til I get where I belong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到寻觅到属于自己的归宿</span></p><p begin="01:17.789" end="01:22.578" itunes:key="L20">(Ooh) Can't slow me down so don't even try it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让我停下来 所以请不要轻易尝试</span></p><p begin="01:23.110" end="01:24.619" itunes:key="L21">You tell me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾告诉我 这一切不会改变的</span></p><p begin="01:25.678" end="01:27.588" itunes:key="L22">Nothing needs to change</p><p begin="01:27.759" end="01:31.469" itunes:key="L23">But I don't think I believe that<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不这么认为</span></p><p begin="01:32.308" end="01:34.540" itunes:key="L24">You fight mе<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你曾与我的战斗 我不能一直惦记着致失眠</span></p><p begin="01:34.679" end="01:36.719" itunes:key="L25">But I can't keep losing sleep</p><p begin="01:36.879" end="01:40.437" itunes:key="L26">Yeah, I'm running out of steam, ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一想到这里 我就会喘不过气来</span></p><p begin="01:40.539" end="01:42.759" itunes:key="L27">(Ooh) And it breaks my hеart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的心碎了一地</span></p><p begin="01:42.907" end="01:45.108" itunes:key="L28">Why is everything so goddamn hard?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么忘掉这一切这么难?</span></p><p begin="01:45.229" end="01:47.418" itunes:key="L29">(Ooh) And I can't look back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一但我回望往事…</span></p><p begin="01:47.519" end="01:49.598" itunes:key="L30">I don't wanna be stuck in the past<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不想再回到过去…</span></p><p begin="01:49.708" end="01:52.779" itunes:key="L31">(Ooh) And it breaks my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为曾经的那些事 让我心碎</span></p><p begin="01:52.889" end="01:54.198" itunes:key="L32">Yeah you broke my heart<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时候 你无情的伤害了我的心</span></p><p begin="01:54.288" end="01:58.627" itunes:key="L33">(Ooh) I don't wanna hear you tell me lies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不再相信你对我说的每一句谎言</span></p><p begin="01:58.839" end="01:59.960" itunes:key="L34">Decaying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便我的堕落 我也无法改变</span></p><p begin="02:00.079" end="02:02.099" itunes:key="L35">I can't stop decaying</p><p begin="02:02.247" end="02:06.757" itunes:key="L36">Life's a simple game, but I don't wanna waste it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活也许只是一场简简单单的游戏 我不想让它流逝掉</span></p><p begin="02:06.859" end="02:08.969" itunes:key="L37">I can't stop decaying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">堕落 我无法改变它, 堕落 我无法改变它</span></p><p begin="02:09.129" end="02:11.329" itunes:key="L38">I can't stop decaying</p><p begin="02:11.468" end="02:13.677" itunes:key="L39">Feels like I'm dying<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种感觉就像是快到达命运尽头</span></p><p begin="02:13.828" end="02:16.977" itunes:key="L40">Cannot change my mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不能操纵这一切</span></p><p begin="02:17.198" end="02:19.357" itunes:key="L41">(Ooh) And it hurts so bad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管很疼</span></p><p begin="02:19.499" end="02:21.647" itunes:key="L42">I don't wanna be stuck in the past<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也不想再回到过去</span></p><p begin="02:21.810" end="02:23.888" itunes:key="L43">(Ooh) And I know it's hard<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管很难做到</span></p><p begin="02:24.018" end="02:26.218" itunes:key="L44">Accepting everything beside the scars<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我逐渐接受身上的伤痕</span></p><p begin="02:26.329" end="02:28.538" itunes:key="L45">(Ooh) And I will not stop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想我不会停止的</span></p><p begin="02:28.668" end="02:30.860" itunes:key="L46">Not 'til I get where I belong<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">直到寻觅到属于自己的归宿</span></p><p begin="02:30.967" end="02:35.779" itunes:key="L47">(Ooh) Can't slow me down so don't even try it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让我停下来 所以请不要轻易尝试</span></p></div></body></tt>